# Title: Suspicious Rundll32 Execution With Image Extension
# ID: 4aa6040b-3f28-44e3-a769-9208e5feb5ec
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Hieu Tran
# Date: 2023-03-13
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.011
# Description: Detects the execution of Rundll32.exe with DLL files masquerading as image files
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*.bmp*" OR process_exec="*.cr2*" OR process_exec="*.eps*" OR process_exec="*.gif*" OR process_exec="*.ico*" OR process_exec="*.jpeg*" OR process_exec="*.jpg*" OR process_exec="*.nef*" OR process_exec="*.orf*" OR process_exec="*.png*" OR process_exec="*.raw*" OR process_exec="*.sr2*" OR process_exec="*.tif*" OR process_exec="*.tiff*")) AND ((process_path="*\\rundll32.exe") OR (process_name="RUNDLL32.exe")))
